in slope","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கவாஅன்","parts":[{"text":"கவாஅன்","lemma":"கவான்","gloss":"mountain slope"}],"gloss":"mountain slope"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மழைமுழங்கு","parts":[{"text":"மழை","lemma":"மழை","gloss":"thundercloud"},{"text":"முழங்கு","lemma":"முழங்கு","gloss":"roar"}],"gloss":"roaring of thunderclouds"},{"surface":"கடுங்குரல்","parts":[{"text":"கடும்","lemma":"கடும்","gloss":"harsh"},{"text":"குரல்","lemma":"குரல்","gloss":"sound"}],"gloss":"harsh sound"},{"surface":"ஓர்க்கும்","parts":[{"text":"ஓர்க்கும்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"listen to"}],"gloss":"listening to"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கழை","parts":[{"text":"கழை","lemma":"கழை","gloss":"bamboo"}],"gloss":"bamboo"},{"surface":"திரங்கு","parts":[{"text":"திரங்கு","lemma":"திரங்கு","gloss":"wither"}],"gloss":"withered"},{"surface":"ஆர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ஆர்","gloss":"difficult"}],"gloss":"difficult"},{"surface":"இடை","parts":[{"text":"இடை","lemma":"இடை","gloss":"path"}],"gloss":"path"},{"surface":"அவனொடு","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"அவன்","gloss":"he"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with him"},{"surface":"செலவே","parts":[{"text":"செலவு","lemma":"செலவு","gloss":"journey"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"journey indeed"}]}],"literal":"She does not even drink milk, she does not play with her ball / she who was playing with her playmates now indeed / did she think it was easy, the withered branch / of the ōmai tree gored by the high-tusked male elephant / on the hot mountain slope of the summer hill / listening to the harsh sound of roaring thunderclouds / her journey with him through the difficult path where bamboo is withered?","translation":"She refuses even her milk and no longer plays with her ball. She who used to delight in the company of her playmates—did she think it would be easy to journey with him through the difficult path of withered bamboo, on the hot slopes of the summer hills, where a male elephant gores the withered branches of the ōmai tree, mistaking the sound for the harsh roar of thunderclouds?","modern":"அவள் பாலும் குடிக்கவில்லை; தன் பந்துடனும் விளையாடவில்லை. தன் தோழிகளுடன் கூடி விளையாடி மகிழ்ந்தவள், இப்போது, கோடைகாலத்து மலையின் வெப்பமான சரிவிலே, மேகம் முழங்கும் கடுமையான இடிக்குரல் என்று நினைத்து ஓமை மரத்தின் காய்ந்த கிளையைக் குத்திய உயர்ந்த கொம்புகளையுடைய ஆண் யானை இருக்கும், மூங்கில்கள் காய்ந்துபோன அரிய வழியில் அவனோடு நடந்து செல்வதை எளிதானது என்று நினைத்துவிட்டாளோ?","explanation":"This poem is set in the Pālai (wasteland) landscape, spoken by the foster-mother (cevili) who laments the elopement of the young heroine with her lover. The foster-mother expresses her deep concern and wonder at how her tender daughter, who previously refused even milk and play, could endure such a harsh journey. The imagery of the male elephant goring the dry ōmai tree, mistaking its cracking sound or the dry wind for the roar of thunderclouds, highlights the extreme heat and deceptive, dangerous nature of the desert path. The withered bamboo (kāḻai tiraṅku) further emphasizes the desolation of the landscape. Key words include 'uṇṇāḷ' (she does not drink), 'oruttal' (male elephant), and 'āriṭai' (difficult path).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}